menu "Daikin AC"

    config DAIKIN_ANTENNA_EXTERNAL_DEFAULT
        bool "Default to the external u.FL antenna"
        default n
        help
            Antenna used when none has been chosen yet. Off selects the onboard ceramic
            antenna, on selects the u.FL connector. A choice made with the 5-click button
            gesture is stored in NVS and takes precedence over this default. There is no
            automatic fallback: with u.FL selected and no antenna attached the Thread link
            will degrade or drop.

endmenu
